From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yash Dayani <52958495+YashDayani@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:16:25 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: start Compose QS with Internet, Bluetooth,
 Flashlight, Modes wide

Android 16-style default for kyoto's Quick Settings: the most used
toggles start as wide tiles, everything else as round icon tiles in the
4-column grid. Cast is not in kyoto's tile list, so it no longer takes a
wide slot. Users can still resize any tile in edit mode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../qs/panels/data/repository/DefaultLargeTilesRepository.kt    | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/qs/panels/data/repository/DefaultLargeTilesRepository.kt b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/qs/panels/data/repository/DefaultLargeTilesRepository.kt
index 9a1671df..5c1ca2a5 100644
--- a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/qs/panels/data/repository/DefaultLargeTilesRepository.kt
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/qs/panels/data/repository/DefaultLargeTilesRepository.kt
@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@ class DefaultLargeTilesRepositoryImpl @Inject constructor() : DefaultLargeTilesR
         setOf(
             TileSpec.create("internet"),
             TileSpec.create("bt"),
+            TileSpec.create("flashlight"),
             TileSpec.create("dnd"),
-            TileSpec.create("cast"),
         )
 }
